<title>USA: ARCO names Slater president of coal division.</title>
<headline>ARCO names Slater president of coal division.</headline>
<dateline>LOS ANGELES 1997-07-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Atlantic Richfield Co. (ARCO) announced on Tuesday the election of John Slater as senior vice president and president of ARCO Coal Company, effective August 18.</p>
<p>Slater, 53, joined ARCO after 19 years with British Petroleum International.</p>
<p>With coal mining operations worldwide, ARCO Coal is based in Denver, Colo.</p>
<p>((David Brinkerhoff, Los Angeles bureau +1 213 380 2014))</p>
</text>
